   "rating": 3,
   "date": "2019-08-10T19:12:15-05:00",
   "body": "For what it's worth, after killing 20 or so lower level boars on the western side, I found crossing the loch and killing the elder mountain boars (Lvl 16-17) a good option.\r\n\r\nTakes a little extra time but I got all three intestines in under 10 kills. Also remember to save them if you've come from killing boars in Westfall (unlike me).",
