  {
   "rating": 3,
   "date": "2019-10-23T11:56:12-05:00",
   "body": "If you're looking at the comments on this recipe, plan, or quest you might be a collector or completionist. \nThis is a compiled list of all of the cross-faction recipes in the game.\n\nMost (not all) [skill=185] recipes on the Alliance side are sold by [npc=340]. The Horde do not have a corresponding NPC, so if you are an Alliance character wanting to create an alt on the opposite side to obtain the recipes for your main, unfortunately you'll have to have a level appropriate character to do the quests to obtain some of these recipes.\n\nAll of the recipes except one ([item=7994]) can be traded cross-faction on the neutral AH.\n\n\n[b]Alliance Only Recipes[/b]\n\n[table border=2]\n[tr][td][b]Item[/b][/td][td][b]Quest / Vendor[/b][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td] [/td][td] [/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][b][skill=164][/b][/td][td][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td] [/td][td] [/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=9367][/td][td][quest=2758][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=6735][/td][td][quest=1618][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td] [/td][td] [/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][b][skill=185][/b][/td][td][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=2889][/td][td][quest=384] / [npc=340][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=3679][/td][td][quest=418] / [npc=340][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=5528][/td][td][npc=4305] / [npc=4307][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=3681][/td][td][quest=471] /  [npc=340][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=3678][/td][td][quest=385] /  [npc=340][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=3683][/td][td][quest=93] /  [npc=340][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=2697][/td][td][quest=22] /  [npc=340][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=6329][/td][td][npc=1684][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=3680][/td][td][quest=127] /  [npc=340][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=2699][/td][td][quest=92] /  [npc=340][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=2701][/td][td][quest=90] /  [npc=340][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=3736][/td][td][quest=564][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=728][/td][td][quest=38] /  [npc=340][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td] [/td][td] [/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][b][skill=202][/b][/td][td][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=18649][/td][td][npc=5175] / [npc=1304][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td]